        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 🎬 Miniature Disaster BTS Generator\n\nCreate viral videos in the style of **@wonderfulworldai** (700M+ views on Instagram).\n\n**Concept:** AI-generated \"behind-the-scenes\" footage showing a film crew shooting miniature city disasters. The fake BTS style creates viral engagement.\n\n**Pipeline:** City + Disaster → Build image prompt → Generate still → Build motion prompt → Animate → Output\n\n**Format:** 9:16 vertical for Instagram/TikTok Reels"
