        "type": "nodetool.text.Prompt",
        "data": {
          "prompt": "Animate this behind-the-scenes film set photograph. The {{ disaster }} in the miniature {{ city }} model should have dramatic motion - water splashing, debris flying, dust clouds rising.\n\nCamera operators should have subtle movements, adjusting their equipment. The miniature destruction should be the hero action.\n\nSmooth dolly movement slightly pushing in toward the miniature disaster. Practical effects motion: water spray, dust particles, small debris. Film set lights may flicker subtly.\n\n8 second dramatic reveal with building tension."
        },
